    "updated_at": "2017-07-10T15:49:06Z",
    "body": "Thank you for helping me understand the process for changing the standard.\r\n\r\nTaking a step back it seems the problem is not in the standard but in the documentation of indeterminate progress bars on other sites.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
